1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,680
Dodo: Hi, little explorers! I'm Dodo!

2
00:00:07,930 --> 00:00:11,136
Dini: And I'm Dini! Dino-hello!

3
00:00:11,386 --> 00:00:14,671
Dodo: Today we are going on an A B C adventure!

4
00:00:14,921 --> 00:00:18,492
Dini: Letters! I love letters! Let's go!

5
00:00:19,642 --> 00:00:21,276
Dodo: A is for apple!

6
00:00:21,526 --> 00:00:22,974
Dodo: Can you say A?

7
00:00:24,674 --> 00:00:26,572
Dini: B is for ball!

8
00:00:27,722 --> 00:00:29,716
Dodo: C is for cat!

9
00:00:29,966 --> 00:00:31,528
Dini: D is for dog!

10
00:00:32,678 --> 00:00:34,521
Dodo: E is for elephant!

11
00:00:34,771 --> 00:00:36,533
Dini: F is for fish!

12
00:00:37,683 --> 00:00:41,340
Dini: G is for... giraffe? No, wait!

13
00:00:41,590 --> 00:00:46,601
Dodo: Silly Dini! G is for grapes, and giraffe too!

14
00:00:47,751 --> 00:00:49,669
Dodo: G is for grapes!

15
00:00:49,919 --> 00:00:51,289
Dini: H is for hat!

16
00:00:52,439 --> 00:00:54,490
Dodo: I is for ice cream!

17
00:00:54,740 --> 00:00:56,351
Dini: J is for jelly!

18
00:00:57,501 --> 00:00:59,256
Dodo: K is for kite!

19
00:00:59,506 --> 00:01:01,199
Dini: L is for lion!

20
00:01:02,349 --> 00:01:03,799
Dodo: M is for moon!

21
00:01:04,049 --> 00:01:05,600
Dodo: Can you say M?

22
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:08,648
Dini: N is for nest!

23
00:01:09,798 --> 00:01:11,654
Dodo: O is for orange!

24
00:01:11,904 --> 00:01:13,757
Dini: P is for pig!

25
00:01:14,907 --> 00:01:16,723
Dodo: Q is for queen!

26
00:01:17,873 --> 00:01:20,272
Dini: R is for rainbow!

27
00:01:20,522 --> 00:01:22,224
Dodo: S is for sun!

28
00:01:23,374 --> 00:01:25,214
Dini: T is for tree!

29
00:01:26,364 --> 00:01:28,502
Dodo: U is for umbrella!

30
00:01:29,652 --> 00:01:31,677
Dini: V is for van!

31
00:01:32,827 --> 00:01:34,700
Dodo: W is for whale!

32
00:01:35,850 --> 00:01:38,013
Dini: X is for xylophone!

33
00:01:38,263 --> 00:01:40,318
Dodo: Y is for yo-yo!

34
00:01:41,468 --> 00:01:43,320
Dini: Z is for zebra!

35
00:01:44,470 --> 00:01:47,903
Dodo: Let's play a letter game! What letter is this?

36
00:01:48,153 --> 00:01:49,683
Dodo: What letter is this?

37
00:01:51,783 --> 00:01:54,410
Dini: B! B is for ball!

38
00:01:54,910 --> 00:01:56,496
Dodo: What letter is this?

39
00:01:58,596 --> 00:02:00,593
Dini: S! S is for sun!

40
00:02:01,093 --> 00:02:02,638
Dodo: What letter is this?

41
00:02:04,738 --> 00:02:07,674
Dini: Z! Z is for zebra!

42
00:02:09,074 --> 00:02:11,759
Dodo: Let's say the whole alphabet together!

43
00:02:12,009 --> 00:02:16,831
Dodo: A, B, C, D, E, F, G

44
00:02:17,081 --> 00:02:24,764
Dini: H, I, J, K, L, M, N, O, P

45
00:02:25,014 --> 00:02:30,047
Dodo: Q, R, S, T, U, V

46
00:02:30,297 --> 00:02:33,738
Dini: W, X, Y and Z!

47
00:02:33,988 --> 00:02:38,232
Dodo: Wow! We learned all the letters from A to Z!

48
00:02:39,382 --> 00:02:43,342
Dodo: Share this video with a friend who loves the A B C!

49
00:02:43,592 --> 00:02:46,600
Dodo & Dini: See you next time, little explorers!

